{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 02 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">稠密预测与医学分割：从像素输出到自配置系统</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Dense Segmentation</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_008_v_net-title\">V-Net</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">3D residual FCN 与直接可微 Dice overlap objective 的结合。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Volumetric 3D residual encoder–decoder trained directly with a differentiable Dice overlap objective.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">3D 医学体数据</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">3D medical imaging volume</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">前景概率体或多类体素分割</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Foreground probability volume or multi-class voxel segmentation</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1109/3DV.2016.79\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_008_v_net')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_008_v_net')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"V-Net original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/edebfde2e5b359a60fd3.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_008_v_net', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_008_v_net\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_008_v_net')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_008_v_net', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_008_v_net\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">3D 输入</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3D input</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">体数据直接进入全卷积分割网络。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d medical imaging volume and prepares initial tensor representations (3D input).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"体数据直接进入全卷积分割网络。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 3d medical imaging volume and prepares initial tensor representations (3D input).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"3D 输入\" data-node-name-en=\"3D input\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_008_v_net', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">3D 输入</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3D input</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">体数据直接进入全卷积分割网络。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d medical imaging volume and prepares initial tensor representations (3D input).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"多层 3D Conv 的输出与 stage 输入相加。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Residual 3D Stage to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Residual 3D Stage\" data-node-name-en=\"Residual 3D Stage\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_008_v_net', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Residual 3D Stage</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">多层 3D Conv 的输出与 stage 输入相加。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Residual 3D Stage to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"用可学习 stride-2 卷积替代固定池化完成降采样。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Strided Conv within the core residual volumetric segmentation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Strided Conv\" data-node-name-en=\"Strided Conv\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_008_v_net', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Strided Conv</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">用可学习 stride-2 卷积替代固定池化完成降采样。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Strided Conv within the core residual volumetric segmentation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"低分辨率残差块聚合大范围三维结构。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 04 within the core residual volumetric segmentation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"深层体上下文\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 04\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_008_v_net', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">深层体上下文</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 04</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">低分辨率残差块聚合大范围三维结构。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 04 within the core residual volumetric segmentation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"转置卷积逐级恢复体素尺度。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 3D Deconv within the core residual volumetric segmentation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"3D Deconv\" data-node-name-en=\"3D Deconv\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_008_v_net', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D Deconv</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">转置卷积逐级恢复体素尺度。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 3D Deconv within the core residual volumetric segmentation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"编码器特征与对应解码尺度融合。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Encoder Skip within the core residual volumetric segmentation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Encoder Skip\" data-node-name-en=\"Encoder Skip\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_008_v_net', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Encoder Skip</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">编码器特征与对应解码尺度融合。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Encoder Skip within the core residual volumetric segmentation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"全卷积输出前景概率体。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies voxel to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"体素概率头\" data-node-name-en=\"voxel\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_008_v_net', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">体素概率头</span><span class=\"lang-en\">voxel</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">全卷积输出前景概率体。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies voxel to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"直接优化预测与真值集合的重叠，而非被背景主导的逐体素准确率。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces foreground probability volume or multi-class voxel segmentation via Dice Objective.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"Dice Objective\" data-node-name-en=\"Dice Objective\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_008_v_net', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Dice Objective</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">直接优化预测与真值集合的重叠，而非被背景主导的逐体素准确率。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces foreground probability volume or multi-class voxel segmentation via Dice Objective.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"V-Net Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · V-Net 直接优化体素级 Dice 重叠</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Direct Optimization of Differentiable Volumetric Dice Overlap</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"V-Net：核心公式 · V-Net 直接优化体素级 Dice 重叠\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"8\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"24.978047pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -69.011212 106.777751 24.978047\" width=\"106.777751pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M5.697191-2.272921V-2.828745H.615376V-2.272921H5.697191Z\" id=\"m008_g7-0\"></path><path d=\"M7.364661-.665003L7.315034-.764257C6.888241-.297763 6.26294 0 5.627713 0C4.545842 0 3.503673-.327539 2.47143-.595525C3.5533-1.558291 4.168676-2.650087 4.406886-4.079348C4.525991-4.823754 4.635171-6.511075 5.67734-6.511075C6.114059-6.511075 6.491225-6.352269 6.491225-5.855998C6.491225-5.657489 6.39197-5.468906 6.253014-5.32995V-5.220771C6.491225-5.300174 7.265407-5.657489 7.265407-5.945326C7.265407-6.580553 6.441597-6.838614 5.925476-6.838614C3.215836-6.838614 3.384568-4.02972 2.858521-2.133965C2.769192-1.796501 2.302697-.744406 1.895755-.744406C1.617843-.744406 1.349857-.853586 1.071945-.853586C.704705-.853586 .208434-.12903 .069478 .168732L.119105 .23821C.287837 .099254 .535973-.059553 .764257-.059553C2.441653-.059553 3.980093 .853586 5.657489 .853586C6.669882 .853586 7.066899 .198508 7.364661-.665003Z\" id=\"m008_g7-76\"></path><path d=\"M2.828745-2.878372H.615376V-2.223294H2.828745V0H3.483822V-2.223294H5.697191V-2.878372H3.483822V-5.101666H2.828745V-2.878372Z\" id=\"m008_g7-184\"></path><path d=\"M1.934564-.746293L1.825881-.825994C1.