\" y=\"-53.758732\"></use><use x=\"-44.154341\" xlink:href=\"#m008_g1-61\" y=\"-55.253113\"></use><use x=\"-35.050772\" xlink:href=\"#m008_g20-49\" y=\"-55.253113\"></use><use x=\"-27.855586\" xlink:href=\"#m008_g7-0\" y=\"-55.253113\"></use><use x=\"-8.517114\" xlink:href=\"#m008_g20-50\" y=\"-62.037379\"></use><use x=\"-1.875394\" xlink:href=\"#m008_g4-205\" y=\"-69.011212\"></use><use x=\"6.174405\" xlink:href=\"#m008_g10-56\" y=\"-59.820701\"></use><use x=\"11.682015\" xlink:href=\"#m008_g13-63\" y=\"-62.037379\"></use><use x=\"17.06184\" xlink:href=\"#m008_g10-56\" y=\"-60.542999\"></use><use x=\"20.241549\" xlink:href=\"#m008_g13-54\" y=\"-62.037379\"></use><use x=\"25.322498\" xlink:href=\"#m008_g10-56\" y=\"-60.542999\"></use><rect height=\".557905\" width=\"56.145245\" x=\"-18.109971\" y=\"-58.092456\"></rect><use x=\"-18.109971\" xlink:href=\"#m008_g4-205\" y=\"-54.410782\"></use><use x=\"-10.060171\" xlink:href=\"#m008_g10-56\" y=\"-45.220271\"></use><use x=\"-4.552561\" xlink:href=\"#m008_g13-63\" y=\"-47.436949\"></use><use x=\".827264\" xlink:href=\"#m008_g17-50\" y=\"-50.951753\"></use><use x=\".827264\" xlink:href=\"#m008_g10-56\" y=\"-44.112867\"></use><use x=\"7.175619\" xlink:href=\"#m008_g7-184\" y=\"-47.436949\"></use><use x=\"15.725721\" xlink:href=\"#m008_g4-205\" y=\"-54.410782\"></use><use x=\"23.775521\" xlink:href=\"#m008_g10-56\" y=\"-45.220271\"></use><use x=\"28.61563\" xlink:href=\"#m008_g13-54\" y=\"-47.436949\"></use><use x=\"33.900815\" xlink:href=\"#m008_g17-50\" y=\"-50.951753\"></use><use x=\"33.696579\" xlink:href=\"#m008_g10-56\" y=\"-44.112867\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">3D 前景极小，交叉熵易被背景主导</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Small 3D anatomical targets occupy a tiny fraction of voxels, causing standard cross-entropy to collapse toward background.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">3D residual FCN 直接优化 Dice 型目标</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Combine a 3D residual convolutional encoder–decoder with a differentiable soft Dice loss.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">残差 3D 编解码器与面向重叠度的 Dice loss</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Strided 3D convolutions replacing pooling, block-wise residual shortcuts, and direct overlap optimization.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">推动 Dice 型目标在医学体分割中的普及</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Popularized Dice-family losses (Dice + CE) as the standard training objective for medical volumetric segmentation.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">经典强基线；并非唯一 3D 默认网络</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Classic 3D baseline; Dice loss alone remains insensitive to boundary Hausdorff outliers and topological breaks.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">残差 3D 编解码器同时缓解深层优化与体数据上下文建模困难。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">strided convolution 让下采样本身可学习。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">Dice 型目标以集合重叠归一化前景规模，缓解极端类别不平衡。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Combine a 3D residual convolutional encoder–decoder with a differentiable soft Dice loss.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Strided 3D convolutions replacing pooling, block-wise residual shortcuts, and direct overlap optimization.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Direct Optimization of Differentiable Volumetric Dice Overlap.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">V-Net 是理解 3D residual segmentation 与 Dice-family loss 的经典节点。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">Dice 高并不保证边界距离、拓扑或小病灶检出，仍应联合 HD95/NSD 和 lesion-wise 指标。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Popularized Dice-family losses (Dice + CE) as the standard training objective for medical volumetric segmentation.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Classic 3D baseline; Dice loss alone remains insensitive to boundary Hausdorff outliers and topological breaks.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1109/3DV.2016.79\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>V-Net: Fully Convolutional Neural Networks for Volumetric Medical Image Segmentation</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<span class=\"spec-muted-val\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">未提供官方实现</span><span class=\"lang-en\">No Official Repository</span></span>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
